// Title: Potential Persistence Via Shim Database In Uncommon Location
// ID: 6b6976a3-b0e6-4723-ac24-ae38a737af41
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-08-01
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1546.011
// Description: Detects the installation of a new shim database where the file is located in a non-default location
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\AppCompatFlags\\InstalledSDB\\") AND where(TargetObject ICONTAINS "\\DatabasePath"))) AND NOT ((where(Details ICONTAINS ":\\Windows\\AppPatch\\Custom"))))
